ROADMAP.md
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/`: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so the negations below would never be reached.
#
# These describe the module rather than the operator, and a module contract
# that cannot travel with the code it describes is not a contract, it is a note.
docs/*
!docs/MODULE_FACTORY_SPEC.md
!docs/UI_STATES.md
!docs/WORK_BRIEF.md
!docs/PURGEX_SCIENTIFIC_FOUNDATIONS.md
!docs/BIBLIOGRAPHY.md
!docs/OPUS_MISSION_BRIEFING.md
!docs/DYNAMIC_ISLAND_3TIER_BLUEPRINT.md
*.bak

# Rewrite/factory planning notes — internal, not part of the module.
NON_DERIVATIVE_ROADMAP.txt
Module_Software_Factory.txt

